    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D — Search Engine Dedicated Performance Benchmark Gates. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Four benchmark gates for the search engine hot paths using in-process stubs. Results are captured and compared against the thresholds below during the Wave D sign-off run.</para>
<sect1 id="bench__search__dedicated__gates_8cpp_1autotoc_md2_1s1"><sect2 id="bench__search__dedicated__gates_8cpp_1autotoc_md2">
<title>Gate definitions</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>SE-BM-01 : FTS query p95 latency ≤ 1 000 µs per search</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SE-BM-02 : Ranking p95 latency ≤ 2 000 µs per ranking call</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SE-BM-03 : Facet filter p95 latency ≤ 500 µs per filter</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SE-BM-04 : Concurrent search throughput ≥ 5 000 searches/sec (8 threads)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
